gahG(){return"How do I change a member\u2019s role?"},
gagY(){return"Only the owner can change roles. Open project settings, select the member\u2019s group and press the Role control on their card. Choose Admin, Normal or Limited, then press Save changes. You can also change the role while the account is pending confirmation."},
gagZ(){return"The change applies to every group the person belongs to in that project. Moving them or adding them to another group in the same project preserves that role. Role changes take effect when you save; leaving without saving discards them."},
gahU(){return"What is the difference between the owner and an Admin?"},
gahg(){return"The owner is the only person who can manage the project, invite and remove members, and change their roles. Other Admin members have the visibility provided by their role and remain in the editable members list; the owner is excluded from that list. Assigning the Admin role does not transfer ownership. To change the owner, use Transfer ownership in the menu of a member with a confirmed account."},
